                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24776: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of California</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stephens</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Sacramento</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 19,
                        1920</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 5:34 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Several United States Governors are invited to inaugural ceremonies of President
                    Obregón of Mexico. Does State Department advise trip being made? Kindly advise
                    at once.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. D. Stephens</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
